\ Slow integration checks for NEXT with seal 11 and PREVIOUS with seal 12.
\ These checks require repeated complete sauce calculations for many gates.
\ They are deliberately not called by the ordinary test runner.
\ They compare boundary inclusion and canonical year numbering.
\ The calculation day in all cases is exactly Foundation Day.
\
\ Year 5000 for Foundation has opening -15057703 and closing -15053459.
\ The following year must open at -15053459, and the preceding year
\ must close at -15057703. The target boundary is included in the
\ previous year, since all year intervals are (opening, closing].

To check the complete Foundation year walk:
  Find the year for -15055671 and -15055671.
  If the year selection success is not 1,
    put "Unable to find the canonical Foundation year." into the check report; exit.
  If the current year number is not 5000,
    put "Foundation was not assigned year 5000." into the check report; exit.
  If the chosen year's opening day is not -15057703,
    put "Foundation year 5000 has the wrong opening gate." into the check report; exit.
  If the chosen year's closing day is not -15053459,
    put "Foundation year 5000 has the wrong closing gate." into the check report; exit.
  Find the year for -15055671 and -15053459.
  If the current year number is not 5000,
    put "A closing gate incorrectly moved into the next year." into the check report; exit.
  Find the year for -15055671 and -15053458.
  If the year selection success is not 1,
    put "Unable to advance from year 5000." into the check report; exit.
  If the current year number is not 5001,
    put "NEXT11 did not advance to year 5001." into the check report; exit.
  If the chosen year's opening day is not -15053459,
    put "NEXT11 did not preserve the year boundary." into the check report; exit.
  If the chosen year's closing day is less than -15053458,
    put "NEXT11 selected a year before the requested day." into the check report; exit.
  Find the year for -15055671 and -15057703.
  If the year selection success is not 1,
    put "Unable to move backwards from year 5000." into the check report; exit.
  If the current year number is not 4999,
    put "PREVIOUS12 did not select year 4999." into the check report; exit.
  If the chosen year's closing day is not -15057703,
    put "PREVIOUS12 did not preserve the year boundary." into the check report; exit.
  If the chosen year's opening day is greater than or equal to -15057703,
    put "PREVIOUS12 incorrectly excludes its closing day." into the check report; exit.
